<p><strong>Description:</strong> ${sysapproval.description}</p>
<p><strong>Priority:</strong> ${sysapproval.priority}</p>
<p><strong>Category:</strong> ${sysapproval.category}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3 style="color: #2c3e50;">Approval Actions</h3>
<p>Please choose one of the following options:</p>
<p><strong>Approve Request:</strong><br><a href="${mail_script:u_approve_link}">Approve Grant Program</a></p>
<p><strong>Reject Request:</strong><br><a href="${mail_script:u_reject_link}">Reject Grant Program</a></p>
